node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
data/raw/climate/*
# The NOAA normals extract is committed; its archive download is not.
!data/raw/climate/noaa_normals/
data/raw/climate/noaa_normals/download/
# The SNOTEL station snowfall extract is committed; its daily downloads are not.
!data/raw/climate/snotel_snowfall/
data/raw/climate/snotel_snowfall/download/
data/raw/openskimap/*.full.geojson
# The terrain extract is committed; its tile download is not.
data/raw/terrain/download/
data/raw/transit/*/gtfs.zip
data/raw/routing/
data/raw/reports/queue/
data/raw/reports/moderated/
# Zillow ZORI: the compact extract data/raw/rent/zillow/zori_extract.csv is committed; the full CSVs
# (downloaded into download/ or placed by hand) and the Census Gazetteer ZCTA file are not.
data/raw/rent/zillow/download/
data/raw/rent/zillow/*_zori_*
data/raw/rent/zillow/*Gaz_zcta*
# Basemap underlay: the Natural Earth zip and TIFF that pipeline/tools/make_underlay.py reads; images/basemap/ is committed.
data/raw/basemap/download/
# The ERA5 jet stream season extract is committed; its per season partial downloads are not.
!data/raw/climate/era5_jet/
data/raw/climate/era5_jet/download/
# The NOAA CPC El Niño and La Niña index files (RONI, ONI) are committed by .github/workflows/enso-index.yml.
!data/raw/climate/enso/
